"<strong>Attention:</strong> Visibility of Progress Bar and Label is Dependent on Customer Address Entry.<br>\n"
"            The Progress Bar and Label will not be visible until the customer enters an address. This behavior is influenced by your WooCommerce settings. To resolve this, navigate to <strong>WooCommerce → Settings → Shipping → Shipping Options</strong>, and ensure that the option <strong>“Hide shipping costs until an address is entered”</strong> is unchecked."
msgstr ""

